'jpg', 'png', 'jpeg' format",dt:"Help your friends join the journey, and watch your wallet grow!",c7:"Include a special character (@,$,!,%,*,?,&)",o:"Initialization vector must be the same length as block size",s:"Input buffer too short or requested length too long",bk:"Invalid characters. Only (@,$,!,%,*,?,&) are allowed.",T:"It seems like you constructed your class using `MyClass._()`. This constructor is only meant to be used by freezed and you are not supposed to need it nor use it.\nPlease check the documentation here for more information: https://github.com/rrousselGit/freezed#adding-getters-and-methods-to-our-models",aJ:"Node already has a parent, copy or remove it first",m:"Output buffer too short or requested length too long",h:"Please enter a text for your link (e.g., 'Learn more')",ea:"Please enter the link URL (e.g., 'https://example.com')",g:"Something went wrong, please report the issue https://www.github.com/incrediblezayed/file_saver/issues",V:"Stream has been disposed.\nAn ImageStream is considered disposed once at least one listener has been added and subsequently all listeners have been removed and no handles are outstanding from the keepAlive method.\nTo resolve this error, maintain at least one listener on the stream, or create an ImageStreamCompleterHandle from the keepAlive method, or create a new stream for the image.",p:"SystemChrome.setApplicationSwitcherDescription",eu:"Take reviews, help others, and earn rewards!.",au:"TextInputClient.updateEditingStateWithDeltas",gP:"TextInputClient.updateEditingStateWithTag",cU:"The Administration Team is dedicated to ensuring the smooth operation and proper management of the hub. They are here to assist with various needs including Facilitation Fee payments and attendance marking. The team is also responsible for maintaining discipline and ensuring punctuality among students, committed to providing support and ensuring a safe and well-functioning environment for everyone. For any medical emergencies or urgent situations, you can also reach out to the Administration Team.",bd:"The Communication Team works to help students enhance their language and communication skills. The team provides assistance, offers constructive feedback, and guides students in building the confidence and clarity needed to excel in both personal and professional interactions. Students are also encouraged to seek personalized support if they encounter any challenges or difficulties during the learning process.",Y:"The Feedback and Grievance Team is responsible for collecting feedback from attendees and addressing any concerns or complaints. They ensure that all issues are heard, investigated, and resolved promptly, helping to improve the overall experience for everyone.",e_:"The Placement Team is committed to guiding candidates in securing IT jobs. Each candidate is assigned a dedicated officer and coordinator to identify job opportunities, refine resumes, and navigate the placement process. The team coordinates interviews, verifies the authenticity of companies, and provides access to multiple opportunities through their network.",dq:"The QA Team is dedicated to enhancing students' technical knowledge by designing domain-specific tasks, managing reviewers, and ensuring the quality of reviews. They provide support to students by addressing concerns related to reviews, reviewers, and technical tasks, fostering continuous improvement in technical skills",fT:"The Student Success Team is dedicated to providing the support and guidance attendees need to thrive during their BROCAMP journey. The team will actively identify attendees who require additional assistance, including access to counseling services, ensuring their needs are effectively addressed. The team will gather and share constructive feedback to facilitate continuous improvement for both attendees and the program.",r:"The `handler` has already been called, make sure each handler gets called only once.",em:"The method or operation is not implemented",a2:"There was a problem trying to load FontManifest.json",t:"Use JsonReader.setLenient(true) to accept malformed JSON",Z:"User password cannot be empty for encrypt only attachment.",ap:"V\u0103 rug\u0103m s\u0103 introduce\u021bi URL-ul link-ului (de exemplu, 'https://example.com')",cK:"V\u0103 rug\u0103m s\u0103 introduce\u021bi un text pentru link-ul dvs. (de exemplu, 'Afla\u021bi mai multe')",e:"You cannot add items while items are being added from addStream",cn:"[A-Za-z\\u00C0-\\u00D6\\u00D8-\\u00F6\\u00F8-\\u02B8\\u0300-\\u0590\\u0800-\\u1FFF\\u2C00-\\uFB1C\\uFDFE-\\uFE6F\\uFEFD-\\uFFFF]",R:"[\\u0591-\\u07FF\\uFB1D-\\uFDFD\\uFE70-\\uFEFC]",gX:"^[^A-Za-z\\u00C0-\\u00D6\\u00D8-\\u00F6\\u00F8-\\u02B8\\u0300-\\u0590\\u0800-\\u1FFF\\u2C00-\\uFB1C\\uFDFE-\\uFE6F\\uFEFD-\\uFFFF]*[\\u0591-\\u07FF\\uFB1D-\\uFDFD\\uFE70-\\uFEFC]",eF:"^https?:\\/\\/[\\w\\-]+(\\.[\\w\\-]+)*(:\\d+)?([\\/\\?#].*)?$",a1:"a9fb57dba1eea9bc3e660a909d838d718c397aa3b561a6f7901e0e82974856a7",cl:"a9fb57dba1eea9bc3e660a909d838d726e3bf623d52620282013481d1f6e5377",hg:"aadd9db8dbe9c48b3fd4e6ae33c9fc07cb308db3b3c9d20ed6639cca70330870553e5c414ca92619418661197fac10471db1d381085ddaddb58796829ca90069",A:"aadd9db8dbe9c48b3fd4e6ae33c9fc07cb308db3b3c9d20ed6639cca703308717d4d9b009bc66842aecda12ae6a380e62881ff2f2d82c68528aa6056583a48f3",fn:"argument is not set to an instance of an object",aP:"c302f41d932a36cda7a3462f9e9e916b5be8f1029ac4acc1",fN:"c302f41d932a36cda7a3463093d18db78fce476de1a86297",fB:"d35e472036bc4fb7e13c785ed201e065f98fcfa5b68f12a32d482ec7ee8658e98691555b44c59311",gK:"d35e472036bc4fb7e13c785ed201e065f98fcfa6f6f40def4f92b9ec7893ec28fcd412b1f1b32e27",bn:"d7c134aa264366862a18302575d0fb98d116bc4b6ddebca3a5a7939f",H:"d7c134aa264366862a18302575d1d787b09f075797da89f57ec8c0ff",bc:"expected-attribute-value-but-got-right-bracket",fF:"expected-closing-tag-but-got-right-bracket",fa:"expected-doctype-name-but-got-right-bracket",e1:"expected-space-or-right-bracket-in-doctype",eG:"ffffffff00000000