B.bKd=new A.a0h(B.aDK,"\ud83d\udcb3 Step 1: Make the Payment","To initiate payment, click the Pay button next to the payment item.\nYou can either:\n\u2022 Be redirected to the payment link.\n\u2022 Or use the copy button to manually copy the link.\n\nIf the amount is not pre-filled in the link, please enter the exact amount shown in the payment request.\n\nComplete the payment using your preferred method.\nAfter payment, take a clear screenshot of the successful payment confirmation.",null)
